<title>HONG KONG: Luk Fook debuts at HK$1.40 per share.</title>
<headline>Luk Fook debuts at HK$1.40 per share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in jewellery manufacturer and retailer Luk Fook Holdings (International) Ltd debuted at HK$1.40 per share on Tuesday compared with the issue price of HK$1.00.</p>
</text>
